ggest obstacle. I really like football. In the 80's I was a Chicago Bears fan. Now I am a green Bay Packers fan. Do you have a favorite team?", "snippet_turn_index": 7, "tokens": 41, "files": ["sessions/2023-07-01-s1.md", "sessions/2023-07-02-s2.md", "sessions/2023-07-03-s3.md"]}, {"session_id": "01KXQZVTT6A2SCXRMRSHMEWAWR", "score": 0, "confidence": null, "mass": null, "snippet": "Speaker 2: That's good. Do you think you're going to let them stay?", "snippet_turn_index": 1, "tokens": 13, "files": ["sessions/2023-07-04-s4.md", "sessions/2023-07-05-s5.md"]}], "knowledge": [], "route": {"gate": "INJECT", "raw": "INJECT top=0.8400 gap=0.4900", "exit_code": 0}, "retrieved_context_tokens": 137, "token_counter": "whitespace", "limit": 5}, "evidence_in_top": true, "evidence_at_5": true, "evidence_at_10": true, "evidence_rank": 0, "miss_reason": "hit", "route_gate": "INJECT", "confidence_top_is_evidence": true, "top_score": 1, "top_confidence": 0.84}
